    "In the raw_euclidean filtration for embedding A, the shuffled-minus-observed component variation gap exceeds 0.02 at 0 of 6 evaluated radii, across 2 sampled cohorts. This is descriptive annotation organization across correlated scales, not a topology significance test or a semantic quality grade.",
